{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27340","headline":"至日上公献寿酒 · 白敏中","name":"至日上公献寿酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"候晓天门辟，朝天万国同。\n瑞云昇观阙，香气映华宫。\n日色临仙籞，龙颜对昊宫。\n羽仪瞻百姓，献寿侍三公。\n化被君王洽，恩沾草木丰。\n自欣朝玉座，宴此咏皇风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白敏中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}